	(text "CAN NODE DESIGN NOTES - TEENSY 4.0 + TCAN332G\n• 3.3 V CAN transceiver w/ standby (TCAN332G)\n• VCC = 3.3 V with local 0.1 µF decoupling at device\n• TXD pull-up to 3.3 V (10k) → recessive during MCU reset\n• STB pull-up to 3.3 V (10k) → default standby; MCU drives LOW after FlexCAN init\n• Direct MCU interface: TXD↔CAN_TX, RXD↔CAN_RX (no level shifting)\n• VREF not used (leave NC)\n• Split termination 2, 60Ω termination only at physical bus ends\n• CAN TVS (SM24CANB-02) at connector; hot plug protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.586 115.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2482b484-ec3e-4442-8cba-740cfc328e14")
	)
	(text "POWER UP SEQUENCE\n• STB pulled HIGH → transceiver silent\n• TXD pulled HIGH → recessive guaranteed\n• Teensy boots\n• FlexCAN init\n• MCU drives STB LOW → clean join"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 134.366 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "94b53408-700e-412e-aabd-4368fe0c9ed6")
	)
